PTX cp.async.mbarrier.arrive+inc
"Without .noinc the pending count is incremented before the asynchronous arrive (9.7.13.15.15), so the arrive does not count towards the phase: with an arrival count of 1 nobody else arrives and the phase never completes. Expected: forbidden."
{
g=1;
d=0 @cta 0;
b=mbarrier(1) @cta 0;
P1:r0=0;
}
 P0@cta 0,cluster 0,gpu 0          | P1@cta 0,cluster 0,gpu 0                       ;
 cp.async.ca.shared.global d, g    | mbarrier.test_wait.parity.acquire.cta r0, b, 0 ;
 cp.async.mbarrier.arrive.shared b |                                                ;
exists
(P1:r0 == 1)
